    {
      "id": "fixes",
      "type": "checklist",
      "duration_s": 8,
      "narration": [
        "Each part of the harness answers a failure they saw.",
        "Declaring victory early: the feature list, and one feature per session.",
        "Messy handoffs: git commits, a progress log, and a smoke test at the start.",
        "Untested features: end-to-end browser testing. And no time lost figuring out how to start the app: init.sh.",
        "Both roles share the same model, tools and harness; only the first prompt differs."
      ],
